('2490', 'Заявка на подбор специалистов', 'Ваше ФИО|-_-|LayonmetxxON|-_-|textInput_-_Компания|-_-|google|-_-|textInput_-_Телефон|-_-||-_-|textInput_-_E-mail|-_-|05@24-polis.ru|-_-|textInput_-_Позиции для поиска|-_-|Хотите рассказать всему миру о себе, о своем товаре, или о вашей компании? Программа для отправки вашего сообщения на все форумы мира, в гостевые книги, в соцсети и т.д, везде, куда можно отправить сообщение. \r\nПрограмма сама регистрируется под вашими данными, обходит средства защиты (капчи), подтверждает электронную почту и т.д. , затем отправляет публичное сообщение на сайты. \r\nТакже есть возможность массовой отправки личных сообщений по всем сайтам. \r\nВы сами выбираете сайты, в зависимости от региона или страны. \r\nПокупка программы и более подробное описание: \r\nhttps://u.to/vargHw|-_-|textarea_-_', '2023-08-15', '1'),
('2491', 'Заявка на подбор специалистов', 'Ваше ФИО|-_-|WilliamHetUY|-_-|textInput_-_Компания|-_-|google|-_-|textInput_-_Телефон|-_-||-_-|textInput_-_E-mail|-_-|zaymthree@whowasable.store|-_-|textInput_-_Позиции для поиска|-_-|Best pipe inspection camera - plumbers camera: \r\n \r\nWhen selecting a camera for pipe and plumbing inspection, ponder the following aspects: \r\n \r\n1. Image quality: Search for a camera with impressive resolution capabilities (at least 720p) and good low-light sensitivity to ensure sharp images in dark pipes. \r\n2. Waterproof rating: Pick a camera with a waterproof rating of at least IP67 or higher to shield it from water damage during inspections. \r\n3. Camera head size: A smaller camera head will allow you to inspect narrower pipes, while a larger head may be needed for bigger pipes. \r\n4. Flexibility: Opt for a camera with a flexible rod or tilt function to assist easier navigation through bends and corners. \r\n5. Length: Select a camera with an adequate length of cable or rod to reach the areas you want to inspect. \r\n6. Light source: Ensure the camera has a sufficient light source, either integrated or detachable, to illuminate the inside of the pipe. \r\n7. Controls: Consider a camera with easy-to-use controls, such as joysticks or buttons, to manipulate the device during the inspection. \r\n8. Recording capability: Some cameras come equipped with recording functionality; if this feature is significant to you, ensure the camera has enough storage capacity and that the video files are easily transferable. \r\n9. Brand reputation: Purchase from a respected brand known for producing reliable equipment. \r\n10. Budget: Determine your budget before making a purchase and assess the features against the cost. \r\n \r\nBear in mind, these are just examples, and it\'s crucial to research each option thoroughly based on your specific requirements and budget. Additionally, consult with industry professionals or read reviews from other plumbers to gain more insight into their experiences with different cameras. best plumbing camera \r\n \r\nBy taking into account these factors, you can discover the best camera for your pipe and plumbing inspection requirements. Always prioritize safety and follow proper safety protocols when conducting inspections.|-_-|textarea_-_', '2023-08-15', '1'),
